Package: LRg
Title: Logistic Regression
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("David J.", "Hessen", , "d.j.hessen@uu.nl", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: David J. Hessen [aut, cre]
Maintainer: David J. Hessen <d.j.hessen@uu.nl>
Description: Functions for fitting different logistic regression models. Models included are the multinomial logistic regression model, the parallel adjacent-categories logit model, and multi-dimensional stereotype ordered and unordered regression models.
